10:46 AM
Two more problems spotted here:

Issue 4: mangum is missing from requirements.txt
Your api/index.py does from mangum import Mangum — but mangum isn't listed. This alone causes an immediate FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED.

Issue 5: pytesseract won't work on Vercel
pytesseract is just a Python wrapper — it requires the Tesseract binary (tesseract-ocr) to be installed on the system. Vercel's serverless runtime doesn't allow installing system binaries, so OCR will always fail there.

Options:

Use a cloud OCR API instead — Google Cloud Vision, AWS Textract, or Azure Computer Vision
Use a pure-Python alternative like easyocr (heavy but no system deps) or rapidocr-onnxruntime
Issue 6: uvicorn is unnecessary on Vercel
Vercel doesn't use uvicorn to run your app — mangum handles that. It won't cause a crash, but it's dead weight.

